ch turn, if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"go","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catches up the same turn and its ","type":"text"},{"code":"arrival","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line trails the room","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"to","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — and the host may ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to park the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to resume."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"steals"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrivals"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"starts(in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)"],"title":"Moving an actor","generated":true,"anchor":"Moving-an-actor"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"follows"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"named"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"name"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"rooms"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Location","